      "description": "Hybrid quantum-classical time series forecasting using a Quantum Neural Network (QNN) and a Hybrid-Quantum Neural Network (HQNN) evaluated on four forecasting problems: Mackey-Glass, Lorenz attractor, Box-Jenkins gas furnace, and USD/EUR exchange rate.",
